   '<b>1. Right to Information:</b> information concerning political funding is essential for voters to make informed political choices under <b>Article 19(1)(a)</b>.',
   '<b>2. Political Equality:</b> large anonymous contributions can give wealthy donors disproportionate influence over political decision-making.',
   '<b>3. Quid Pro Quo:</b> non-disclosure prevents voters from examining possible exchanges of political contributions for government benefits.',
